      "source": "Base implementation for <a href=\"RedisCollection.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.support.collections\"><code>RedisCollection</code></a>. Provides a skeletal implementation. Note that the collection support\nworks only with normal, non-pipeline/multi-exec connections as it requires a reply to be sent right away.",
      "translation": "这是 <a href=\"RedisCollection.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.support.collections\"><code>RedisCollection</code></a> 的基础实现，提供了一个骨架实现。请注意，集合支持仅适用于普通的非管道/多执行连接，因为它需要立即发送回复。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
